{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And your eye shall not spare him</b> (with the letters and words) gematria of אין טוענין למסית (one does not plead for a seducer):" "<b>And you shall not cover</b> Two times: ולא תכסה עליו and ולא תכסה עוד על הרוגיה. And this is what they expounded concerning a seducer: if he left the court liable, they do not return him to acquit. And this is ולא תכסה עוד על הרוגיה — i.e., concerning one who goes out to be executed."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:09:38.050806159Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}